## Data Model (Refined)

### Satellite State (Computed View)

```json
{
  "captured_at": "2026-01-06T14:47:00",
  "depth": {
    "current": 2,
    "max": 5,
    "breadcrumbs": ["Nucleus Architecture", "Brain Consolidation"],
    "indicator": "🟢 ●●○○○"
  },
  "activity": {
    "sparkline": "▁▃▅▇█▅▂",
    "total_events_7d": 47,
    "peak_day": "2026-01-04"
  },
  "session": {
    "id": "session-20260106",
    "context": "Nucleus v0.4.0",
    "active_task": "Brain Architecture Synthesis",
    "lit_pathways": 3
  },
  "health": {
    "artifacts_count": 42,
    "archive_size": 274,
    "stale_files": 5
  }
}
```

